# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ✅ EXCEPTIONS - Files to ALWAYS include
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Flutter tools test data
!/packages/flutter_tools/test/data/dart_dependencies_test/**/.packages

# Keep README and documentation
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE

# Keep example environment file (template only)
!.env.example
!supabase-keys.json.example

